@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true

title Wariant 3: Microsoft.Extensions.ObjectPool

actor "Worker Thread" as T
rectangle "DefaultObjectPool<T>" as P
rectangle "IPooledObjectPolicy<T>" as Policy
rectangle "Resource T" as R

T -> P : Get()
P -> Policy : Create() (gdy pusto)
Policy --> P : new T
P --> T : T

T -> R : Use()
T -> P : Return(T)
P -> Policy : Return(T)
Policy --> P : true/false

note right of Policy
Policy centralizuje
Create i Reset
end note

@enduml
